%% Ingestion with human approval (ingestion/service.py).
sequenceDiagram
    actor Owner as Office owner (officer/admin)
    participant API as P14 API
    participant Ing as IngestionService
    participant P as parser + chunker
    participant DB as SQLite
    participant E as Embedder
    participant Q as Qdrant

    Owner->>API: POST /v1/documents (IngestDocument, X-API-Key)
    API->>Ing: ingest(doc, principal)
    Ing->>Ing: can_manage(office)? otherwise 403
    Ing->>P: parse(bytes, media_type) with type/size/macro/XXE checks
    P-->>Ing: blocks (page, section) then passages with ids
    Ing->>DB: documents (status=pending), document_versions, passages (indexed=0)
    API-->>Owner: 202 {document_id, document_version, status: pending}
    Note over DB,Q: Not searchable yet: nothing written to FTS5 or Qdrant
    Owner->>API: POST /v1/documents/{id}/approve {note}
    API->>Ing: approve(id, principal, note)
    Ing->>E: embed_passages(title + section + text)
    Ing->>Q: upsert points (payload: access_level, office, type, source_id)
    Ing->>Q: delete points of the superseded version
    Ing->>DB: BEGIN, FTS5 insert, indexed=1, old version superseded, approval_log, COMMIT
    Ing->>DB: refresh index_snapshot_id
    API-->>Owner: 200 {status: approved, passages}
